WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.400
Gonza: Agent, help me install the car seat.

00:03.400 --> 00:08.800
Coach: Pull the shoulder belt until it's tight, and keep it flat, with no twists.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.300
Coach: The lap belt looks twisted over the seat.

00:12.300 --> 00:19.900
Coach: Before the first real trip, book a check with a certified child car seat technician.
